DECREE - THE AUTHORITY OF PAIN

Let it be understood by every member who wears the ring:

Pain leads the Dawn. His word carries the weight of a god's, and in this village he
is treated as one. He assigns the pairs, sets the capture order, calls the sealings,
and decides who lives to keep their ring. There is no appeal above him that any
member need concern himself with.

He has known pain the world cannot imagine, and from it he has built the only path to
peace: a peace forced upon a world too foolish to choose it. Through the tailed beasts
he will hold a power that ends all war by making its cost unbearable.

Obey him as you would obey the outcome you were promised. Question the plan and you
question the peace. Neither is yours to question.

- Konan, on behalf of the Leader
